---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Academia Kreativo — Aprende Marketing Digital" description="Programas de formación en marketing digital de Kreativo Studio: curso grabado, seminario presencial y mentorías 1:1 con Enrique Girón.">

<style>
/* ── ACADEMIA PLP ── */

/* Hero */
.acad-hero {
  background: var(--darker);
  padding: 100px 48px 96px;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.acad-hero::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: -240px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: 900px; height: 900px; max-width: 180vw;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,200,202,0.10) 0%, rgba(0,200,202,0.04) 45%, transparent 70%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.acad-hero-inner { position: relative; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
.acad-hero h1 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);
  font-weight: 700; color: #fff;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.05;
  margin: 20px 0 24px;
}
.acad-hero p {
  font-size: 18px; font-weight: 300;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
  line-height: 1.7; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 48px;
}
.acad-creds {
  display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;
  padding-top: 40px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
}
.acad-cred {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-weight: 300;
}
.acad-cred-dot { width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--cyan); flex: 0 0 5px; }

/* Products grid */
.acad-products {
  padding: 96px 48px;
  background: var(--off-white);
}
.acad-products-inner { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; }
.acad-products-head { margin-bottom: 56px; }
.acad-products-head h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 46px);
  font-weight: 700; color: var(--darker);
  letter-spacing: -0.025em; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.acad-products-head p { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--mid-gray); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 560px; }

.acad-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; align-items: start; }

.acad-card {
  background: #fff;
  border: 1px solid var(--light-gray);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  transition: box-shadow 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
}
.acad-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); transform: translateY(-2px); }
.acad-card.featured { border-color: rgba(0,200,202,0.5); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,200,202,0.2); }

.acad-card-visual {
  background: var(--darker);
  padding: 36px 32px 28px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.acad-card-visual::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute; top: -60px; right: -60px;
  width: 200px; height: 200px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,200,202,0.14) 0%, transparent 70%);
}
.acad-card-visual.coming {
  background: #111;
}
.acad-card-badge {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 100px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.badge-live { background: rgba(0,200,202,0.12); color: var(--cyan); border: 1px solid rgba(0,200,202,0.25); }
.badge-featured { background: var(--cyan); color: var(--darker); }
.badge-soon { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
.badge-dot { width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: currentColor; }

.acad-card-type {
  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.acad-card-visual h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700;
  color: #fff; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}
.acad-card-visual .acad-card-tagline {
  font-size: 13px; font-weight: 300;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.5;
}

.acad-card-body { padding: 28px; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

.acad-card-includes {
  list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.acad-card-includes li {
  font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--dark);
  padding-left: 20px; position: relative; line-height: 1.5;
}
.acad-card-includes li::before { content: '\2713'; color: var(--cyan); font-weight: 700; position: absolute; left: 0; }

.acad-card-price { margin-bottom: 24px; }
.acad-card-price-from { font-size: 11px; color: var(--mid-gray); margin-bottom: 2px; }
.acad-card-price-amount {
  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--darker); line-height: 1;
}
.acad-card-price-amount small { font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 300; font-size: 13px; color: var(--mid-gray); letter-spacing: 0; margin-left: 4px; }
.acad-card-price-note { font-size: 12px; color: var(--mid-gray); margin-top: 4px; }

.acad-card-cta { margin-top: auto; }
.acad-card-cta a {
  display: block; text-align: center; padding: 14px 20px;
  border-radius: 100px; font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.2s;
}
.cta-primary-cyan { background: var(--cyan); color: var(--darker); }
.cta-primary-cyan:hover { opacity: 0.88; }
.cta-outline-dark { border: 1.5px solid var(--darker); color: var(--darker); }
.cta-outline-dark:hover { background: var(--darker); color: #fff; }
.cta-disabled { background: var(--off-white); color: var(--mid-gray); cursor: default; border: 1.5px solid var(--light-gray); }
.acad-card-cta-note { font-size: 11px; color: var(--mid-gray); text-align: center; margin-top: 8px; }

/* Coming soon overlay */
.acad-coming-info {
  background: var(--off-white); border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;
}
.acad-coming-info p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--mid-gray); line-height: 1.5; }
.acad-coming-info strong { color: var(--darker); }

/* Why section */
.acad-why { padding: 96px 48px; background: #fff; }
.acad-why-inner { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; }
.acad-why-head { margin-bottom: 56px; }
.acad-why-head h2 { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(26px, 3.2vw, 44px); font-weight: 700; color: var(--darker); letter-spacing: -0.025em; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.acad-why-head p { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--mid-gray); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 560px; }
.acad-why-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
.acad-why-card {
  background: var(--off-white); border: 1px solid var(--light-gray);
  border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 28px 24px;
}
.acad-why-icon {
  width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px;
  background: var(--darker); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}
.acad-why-icon svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; stroke: var(--cyan); fill: none; stroke-width: 1.5; }
.acad-why-card h4 { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--darker); margin-bottom: 10px; }
.acad-why-card p { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--mid-gray); line-height: 1.65; font-weight: 300; }

/* Instructor */
.acad-instructor { padding: 96px 48px; background: var(--darker); }
.acad-instructor-inner { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; }
.acad-inst-card {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 36px;
}
.acad-inst-avatar {
  width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--cyan); color: var(--darker);
  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.acad-inst-name { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
.acad-inst-role { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.acad-inst-creds { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.acad-inst-creds li { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); padding-left: 16px; position: relative; line-height: 1.5; }
.acad-inst-creds li::before { content: '\2713'; color: var(--cyan); font-weight: 700; position: absolute; left: 0; }
.acad-inst-right h2 { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 40px); font-weight: 700; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -0.025em; line-height: 1.1; margin: 16px 0 16px; }
.acad-inst-right p { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.acad-inst-nums { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-top: 36px; padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
.acad-inst-num-val { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1; }
.acad-inst-num-val span { color: var(--cyan); }
.acad-inst-num-label { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); margin-top: 6px; line-height: 1.4; }

/* Testimonials */
.acad-testi { padding: 96px 48px; background: var(--off-white); }
.acad-testi-inner { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; }
.acad-testi-head { margin-bottom: 48px; }
.acad-testi-head h2 { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(26px, 3.2vw, 44px); font-weight: 700; color: var(--darker); letter-spacing: -0.025em; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.acad-testi-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
.acad-testi-card {
  background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--light-gray);
  border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 28px 24px;
}
.acad-stars { display: flex; gap: 3px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.acad-star { width: 13px; height: 13px; fill: #F59E0B; }
.acad-testi-card blockquote { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--dark); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 20px; quotes: none; }
.acad-testi-author { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
.acad-testi-avatar { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; color: #fff; flex: 0 0 36px; }
.acad-testi-name { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--darker); }
.acad-testi-role { font-size: 11px; color: var(--mid-gray); margin-top: 2px; }

/* FAQ */
.acad-faq { padding: 96px 48px; background: #fff; }
.acad-faq-inner { max-width: 840px; margin: 0 auto; }
.acad-faq-head { margin-bottom: 48px; }
.acad-faq-head h2 { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(26px, 3.2vw, 44px); font-weight: 700; color: var(--darker); letter-spacing: -0.025em; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.acad-faq-list { border-top: 1px solid var(--light-gray); }
.acad-faq-item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--light-gray); }
.acad-faq-btn { width: 100%; text-align: left; padding: 20px 0; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
.acad-faq-q { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--darker); line-height: 1.4; }
.acad-faq-icon { width: 20px; height: 20px; flex: 0 0 20px; border: 1.5px solid var(--light-gray); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s; }
.acad-faq-icon svg { width: 10px; height: 10px; stroke: var(--mid-gray); fill: none; stroke-width: 2.5; transition: transform 0.3s; }
.acad-faq-item.open .acad-faq-icon { background: var(--cyan); border-color: var(--cyan); }
.acad-faq-item.open .acad-faq-icon svg { stroke: var(--darker); transform: rotate(45deg); }
.acad-faq-answer { max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.35s ease; }
.acad-faq-answer-inner { font-size: 14px; color: var(--mid-gray); line-height: 1.75; padding-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 300; }
.acad-faq-item.open .acad-faq-answer { max-height: 300px; }

/* CTA */
.acad-cta { background: var(--darker); padding: 96px 48px; text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
.acad-cta::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 60% at 50% 50%, rgba(0,200,202,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%); pointer-events: none; }
.acad-cta-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; }
.acad-cta h2 { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 46px); font-weight: 700; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -0.025em; line-height: 1.1; margin: 16px 0 16px; }
.acad-cta p { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); margin-bottom: 36px; line-height: 1.7; }
.acad-cta-btns { display: flex; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width: 1023px) {
  .acad-hero, .acad-products, .acad-why, .acad-instructor, .acad-testi, .acad-faq, .acad-cta { padding-left: 32px; padding-right: 32px; }
  .acad-instructor-inner { gap: 48px; }
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .acad-hero, .acad-products, .acad-why, .acad-instructor, .acad-testi, .acad-faq, .acad-cta { padding: 72px 20px; }
  .acad-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 440px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .acad-why-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .acad-instructor-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
  .acad-testi-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .acad-inst-nums { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  .acad-cta-btns { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .acad-why-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .acad-creds { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
}
</style>

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="acad-hero">
  <div class="acad-hero-inner">
    <div class="section-tag" style="color:var(--cyan)">Academia Kreativo</div>
    <h1>Aprende marketing de los que lo ejecutan.</h1>
    <p>No enseñamos teoría de libro. Enseñamos lo que hacemos todos los días con clientes reales, presupuestos reales y resultados que se miden en pesos y en conversiones.</p>
    <div class="acad-creds">
      <div class="acad-cred"><span class="acad-cred-dot"></span>Diseñador del Diplomado de Marketing Digital · Anáhuac Online</div>
      <div class="acad-cred"><span class="acad-cred-dot"></span>+1,000 alumnos formados</div>
      <div class="acad-cred"><span class="acad-cred-dot"></span>12 años ejecutando campañas reales</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PRODUCTOS -->
<div class="acad-products">
  <div class="acad-products-inner">
    <div class="acad-products-head">
      <span class="section-tag">Programas</span>
      <h2>Elige cómo quieres aprender.</h2>
      <p>Tres formatos diseñados para distintos momentos y objetivos. Todos con el mismo nivel de exigencia y los mismos casos reales.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="acad-grid">

      <!-- Curso grabado -->
      <div class="acad-card">
        <div class="acad-card-visual">
          <div class="acad-card-badge badge-live"><span class="badge-dot"></span>Disponible ahora</div>
          <div class="acad-card-type">Curso grabado · Hotmart</div>
          <h3>Marketing Digital que Funciona en México</h3>
          <p class="acad-card-tagline">8 módulos, +40 lecciones, 12h de contenido aplicado.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="acad-card-body">
          <ul class="acad-card-includes">
            <li>Acceso de por vida + actualizaciones incluidas</li>
            <li>Plantillas, checklists y recursos por módulo</li>
            <li>Casos reales del mercado mexicano</li>
            <li>Comunidad privada en Hotmart</li>
            <li>Certificado digital de Kreativo Studio</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="acad-card-price">
            <div class="acad-card-price-amount">$1,500<small>MXN</small></div>
            <div class="acad-card-price-note">Pago único · Acceso inmediato · Garantía 7 días</div>
          </div>
          <div class="acad-card-cta">
            <a href="https://go.hotmart.com/J107882493T?dp=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cta-outline-dark">Inscribirme en Hotmart →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mentorías 1:1 -->
      <div class="acad-card featured">
        <div class="acad-card-visual">
          <div class="acad-card-badge badge-featured">Más personalizado</div>
          <div class="acad-card-type">Sesiones en vivo · 1:1</div>
          <h3>Mentorías 1:1 con Enrique Girón</h3>
          <p class="acad-card-tagline">Temario a tu medida, sobre tu proyecto, con quien lo ejecuta.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="acad-card-body">
          <ul class="acad-card-includes">
            <li>Sesiones privadas en vivo de 60 o 90 min</li>
            <li>Temario construido para tu objetivo</li>
            <li>Acompañamiento por WhatsApp entre sesiones</li>
            <li>Todo queda grabado para que lo repases</li>
            <li>Llamada de diagnóstico sin costo</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="acad-card-price">
            <div class="acad-card-price-from">Desde</div>
            <div class="acad-card-price-amount">$2,500<small>MXN / hora</small></div>
            <div class="acad-card-price-note">Programas intensivos desde $12,000 MXN</div>
          </div>
          <div class="acad-card-cta">
            <a href="/academia/mentorias" class="cta-primary-cyan">Ver programa completo →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Seminario presencial -->
      <div class="acad-card">
        <div class="acad-card-visual coming">
          <div class="acad-card-badge badge-soon">Próximamente</div>
          <div class="acad-card-type">Presencial · Trimestral</div>
          <h3>Seminario Intensivo de Marketing Digital</h3>
          <p class="acad-card-tagline">Dos días en CDMX con el equipo de Kreativo Studio.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="acad-card-body">
          <div class="acad-coming-info">
            <p>Estamos trabajando en la primera edición.<br><strong>Q1 2025 · Ciudad de México</strong></p>
          </div>
          <ul class="acad-card-includes">
            <li>2 días intensivos en vivo y presencial</li>
            <li>Grupos reducidos (máx. 20 personas)</li>
            <li>Talleres prácticos con cuentas reales</li>
            <li>Material impreso y digital incluido</li>
            <li>Networking con profesionales de marketing</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="acad-card-cta">
            <a href="https://wa.me/525579606335?text=Hola%20Enrique,%20me%20interesa%20el%20seminario%20presencial%20de%20Academia%20Kreativo" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cta-outline-dark">Avisar cuando esté disponible</a>
            <div class="acad-card-cta-note">Te contactamos en cuanto abramos inscripciones</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- POR QUÉ ES DIFERENTE -->
<div class="acad-why">
  <div class="acad-why-inner">
    <div class="acad-why-head">
      <span class="section-tag">Por qué es diferente</span>
      <h2>Lo que no vas a encontrar en otro curso.</h2>
      <p>Hay miles de cursos de marketing en internet. Esto es lo que hace diferente aprender con quienes llevan 12 años ejecutando campañas.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="acad-why-grid">
      <div class="acad-why-card">
        <div class="acad-why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.07 4.93A10 10 0 0014 2.46M4.93 4.93A10 10 0 002.46 14M4.93 19.07A10 10 0 0014 21.54M19.07 19.07A10 10 0 0021.54 10"/></svg></div>
        <h4>Del mundo real, no del aula</h4>
        <p>Todo el contenido viene de campañas activas con presupuestos reales. No hay ejemplos inventados ni casos de Silicon Valley que no aplican en México.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="acad-why-card">
        <div class="acad-why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg></div>
        <h4>Enfocado en resultados medibles</h4>
        <p>Cada módulo termina con acciones concretas y métricas específicas. Sabes exactamente qué hacer la semana siguiente y cómo medir si funcionó.</p>
      </div>
